usiness_id":"orXtmu7JLqVy9LatRd49Sw","review_id":"7wjBgvOmjD1EAIloEkVY5w","date":"2019-04-04T20:10:15","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9275128841400146,"text_excerpt":"There's nothing that makes a Wal Mart experience better than not having to talk to Wal Mart employees. It's not that I have an issue with anyone who works here; the entire process is just faster if I don't have to interact with people. It's the future; get used to it. So, I needed a few things and Wal Mart makes it super convenient where you can just order off of the website and go pick up your order at the store. So, I ordered my item and the next day I got an email telling me my order was ready to be picked up. Great! All I had to do was walk over to their magic \"order pick up\" kiosk, scan my phone and my item was delivered to me bagged and ready to go. Then, I needed another item from ..."},{"business_id":"orXtmu7JLqVy9LatRd49Sw","review_id":"KNvK-m4bKgEGfiUZfh2wAQ","date":"2018-07-27T17:42:05","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9145023822784424,"text_excerpt":"Why does NOLA get all the cool stuff?! Cherry Cola Oreos... That is not something you can find in Los Angeles. There seems to be an obsession with The South and all things Cola related but I love it! I bought a bag just for kicks and giggles to give to friends back home. My friend wanted to show me a Walmart Supercenter (although I've seen them before in other States outside of California. Full disclosure, I rarely shop at Walmart because I hate how little they pay their employees and their business practice. Having said that, they do offer extremely low prices for things, and I even got a few super hero shirts that I found to be quite amusing. It's a one stop shop for all your grocery, h..."},{"business_id":"orXtmu7JLqVy9LatRd49Sw","review_id":"cxmHhp35eGQl7QXX-Yjv8g","date":"2018-04-14T02:25:06","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9108485579490662,"text_excerpt":"I would've given this place 1star a few weeks ago, but I've experienced the magic of pickup groceries. The people outside are polite and go through your order with you. It's amazing the difference the people make compared to the rudeness inside. Do yourself a favor and order your groceries online. It's so stress free! My order has been correct als the produce has been great!"}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
